arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"31da0530382eb37898bee2119a4bcd8ac49fa008","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/31da0530382eb37898bee2119a4bcd8ac49fa008","created_at":"2026-02-03T11:26:31Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"182cbce60bb022ab4f34f1aae34b5be167449dbb","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDE4MmNiY2U2MGJiMDIyYWI0ZjM0ZjFhYWUzNGI1YmUxNjc0NDlkYmI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/182cbce60bb022ab4f34f1aae34b5be167449dbb","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/182cbce60bb022ab4f34f1aae34b5be167449dbb","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T13:37:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T09:41:07Z"},"tree":{"sha":"23df76c24b4fc717ef764edc87e62ef79b3d3157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/23df76c24b4fc717ef764edc87e62ef79b3d3157"},"message":"zlog: add utility package for safe and consistent logging\n\nAdd hscontrol/util/zlog package with:\n\n- zf subpackage: field name constants for compile-time safety\n- SafeHostinfo: wrapper that redacts device fingerprinting data\n- SafeMapRequest: wrapper that redacts client endpoints\n\nThe zf (zerolog fields) subpackage provides short constant names\n(e.g., zf.NodeID instead of inline \"node.id\" strings) ensuring\nconsistent field naming across all log statements.\n\nSecurity considerations:\n- SafeHostinfo never logs: OSVersion, DeviceModel, DistroName\n- SafeMapRequest only logs endpoint counts, not actual IPs","parents":[{"sha":"9e50071df9ab70730a2921f3e6b3693bc0a60118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/9e50071df9ab70730a2921f3e6b3693bc0a60118","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/9e50071df9ab70730a2921f3e6b3693bc0a60118"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"d375e71e7143fb4ac89b7b37c02a7794b1ed357f","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGQzNzVlNzFlNzE0M2ZiNGFjODliN2IzN2MwMmE3Nzk0YjFlZDM1N2Y","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/d375e71e7143fb4ac89b7b37c02a7794b1ed357f","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/d375e71e7143fb4ac89b7b37c02a7794b1ed357f","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T13:37:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T09:41:11Z"},"tree":{"sha":"bc4d77f94dbb3e261a2d08bde20a8b2c505ab5eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/bc4d77f94dbb3e261a2d08bde20a8b2c505ab5eb"},"message":"types: add MarshalZerologObject to domain types\n\nImplement zerolog.LogObjectMarshaler interface on domain types\nfor structured logging:\n\n- Node: logs node.id, node.name, machine.key (short), node.key (short),\n  node.is_tagged, node.expired, node.online, node.tags, user.name\n- User: logs user.id, user.name, user.display, user.provider\n- PreAuthKey: logs pak.id, pak.prefix (masked), pak.reusable,\n  pak.ephemeral, pak.used, pak.is_tagged, pak.tags\n- APIKey: logs api_key.id, api_key.prefix (masked), api_key.expiration\n\nSecurity: PreAuthKey and APIKey only log masked prefixes, never full\nkeys or hashes. Uses zf.* constants for consistent field naming.","parents":[{"sha":"182cbce60bb022ab4f34f1aae34b5be167449dbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/182cbce60bb022ab4f34f1aae34b5be167449dbb","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/182cbce60bb022ab4f34f1aae34b5be167449dbb"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"43660e84f6000ec019eb8594af69b52b5dc68141","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDQzNjYwZTg0ZjYwMDBlYzAxOWViODU5NGFmNjliNTJiNWRjNjgxNDE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/43660e84f6000ec019eb8594af69b52b5dc68141","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/43660e84f6000ec019eb8594af69b52b5dc68141","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T14:05:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T09:41:52Z"},"tree":{"sha":"9f641e89e8512601fdb4e8fa1e46afa7ebf803d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/9f641e89e8512601fdb4e8fa1e46afa7ebf803d3"},"message":"golangci: add forbidigo rule for zerolog field constants\n\nAdd a lint rule to enforce use of zf.* constants for zerolog field\nnames instead of inline string literals. This catches at lint time\nany new code that doesn't follow the convention.\n\nThe rule matches common zerolog field methods (Str, Int, Bool, etc.)\nand flags any usage with a string literal first argument.","parents":[{"sha":"d375e71e7143fb4ac89b7b37c02a7794b1ed357f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/d375e71e7143fb4ac89b7b37c02a7794b1ed357f","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/d375e71e7143fb4ac89b7b37c02a7794b1ed357f"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"468dbc18803d7a5e2871a50a59dfe8509e7bf67e","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDQ2OGRiYzE4ODAzZDdhNWUyODcxYTUwYTU5ZGZlODUwOWU3YmY2N2U","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/468dbc18803d7a5e2871a50a59dfe8509e7bf67e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/468dbc18803d7a5e2871a50a59dfe8509e7bf67e","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T14:39:34Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T09:41:57Z"},"tree":{"sha":"d7eaee3f0f88f642864dabdd5871aee21afee49b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/d7eaee3f0f88f642864dabdd5871aee21afee49b"},"message":"cmd: use zf constants for zerolog field names\n\nUpdate CLI logging to use zf.* constants instead of inline strings\nfor consistency with the rest of the codebase.","parents":[{"sha":"43660e84f6000ec019eb8594af69b52b5dc68141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/43660e84f6000ec019eb8594af69b52b5dc68141","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/43660e84f6000ec019eb8594af69b52b5dc68141"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"132f609740fdb8ea669a73c65f88fc6c0d79d2bb","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDEzMmY2MDk3NDBmZGI4ZWE2NjlhNzNjNjVmODhmYzZjMGQ3OWQyYmI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/132f609740fdb8ea669a73c65f88fc6c0d79d2bb","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/132f609740fdb8ea669a73c65f88fc6c0d79d2bb","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T09:44:23Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T09:58:01Z"},"tree":{"sha":"45087e9bb84405ff0ec5f0256fad2e5aee114756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/45087e9bb84405ff0ec5f0256fad2e5aee114756"},"message":"hscontrol: use EmbedObject for node logging\n\nReplace manual Uint64(\"node.id\")/Str(\"node.name\") field patterns with\nEmbedObject(node) which automatically includes all standard node fields\n(id, name, machine key, node key, online status, tags, user).\n\nThis reduces code repetition and ensures consistent logging across:\n- state.go: Connect/Disconnect, persistNodeToDB, AutoApproveRoutes\n- auth.go: handleLogout, handleRegisterWithAuthKey","parents":[{"sha":"468dbc18803d7a5e2871a50a59dfe8509e7bf67e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/468dbc18803d7a5e2871a50a59dfe8509e7bf67e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/468dbc18803d7a5e2871a50a59dfe8509e7bf67e"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"b0c71bbbc53c113d492cea338f97dc05a319be84","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGIwYzcxYmJiYzUzYzExM2Q0OTJjZWEzMzhmOTdkYzA1YTMxOWJlODQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b0c71bbbc53c113d492cea338f97dc05a319be84","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b0c71bbbc53c113d492cea338f97dc05a319be84","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:00:49Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:00:49Z"},"tree":{"sha":"aa8d3527f722cd59ccb08b59107f4c62cc96d141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/aa8d3527f722cd59ccb08b59107f4c62cc96d141"},"message":"hscontrol/poll: use sub-logger pattern for mapSession\n\nReplace the helper functions (logf, infof, tracef, errf) with a\nzerolog sub-logger initialized in newMapSession(). The sub-logger\nis pre-populated with session context (component, node, omitPeers,\nstream) eliminating repeated field calls throughout the code.\n\nChanges:\n- Add log field to mapSession struct\n- Initialize sub-logger with EmbedObject(node) and request context\n- Remove logf/infof/tracef/errf helper functions\n- Update all callers to use m.log.Level().Caller()... pattern\n- Update noise.go to use sess.log instead of sess.tracef\n\nThis reduces code by ~20 lines and eliminates ~15 repeated field\ncalls per log statement.","parents":[{"sha":"132f609740fdb8ea669a73c65f88fc6c0d79d2bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/132f609740fdb8ea669a73c65f88fc6c0d79d2bb","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/132f609740fdb8ea669a73c65f88fc6c0d79d2bb"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"f720da6670c5bc779a3b9d7f11b031e36865ec8f","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGY3MjBkYTY2NzBjNWJjNzc5YTNiOWQ3ZjExYjAzMWUzNjg2NWVjOGY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f720da6670c5bc779a3b9d7f11b031e36865ec8f","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f720da6670c5bc779a3b9d7f11b031e36865ec8f","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:01:23Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:01:23Z"},"tree":{"sha":"f24e254ecce0a64e09ce07c66c68cfb1ebc031c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/f24e254ecce0a64e09ce07c66c68cfb1ebc031c4"},"message":"hscontrol/routes: use sub-logger and zf constants\n\nAdd sub-logger pattern to SetRoutes() to eliminate repeated node.id\nfield calls. Replace raw strings with zf.* constants throughout\nthe primary routes code for consistent field naming.\n\nChanges:\n- Add nlog sub-logger in SetRoutes() with node.id context\n- Replace \"prefix\" with zf.Prefix\n- Replace \"changed\" with zf.Changes\n- Replace \"newState\" with zf.NewState\n- Replace \"finalState\" with zf.FinalState","parents":[{"sha":"b0c71bbbc53c113d492cea338f97dc05a319be84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b0c71bbbc53c113d492cea338f97dc05a319be84","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b0c71bbbc53c113d492cea338f97dc05a319be84"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"0df60b365af628878909a14901acd21ec979d326","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDBkZjYwYjM2NWFmNjI4ODc4OTA5YTE0OTAxYWNkMjFlYzk3OWQzMjY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/0df60b365af628878909a14901acd21ec979d326","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/0df60b365af628878909a14901acd21ec979d326","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:01:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:01:41Z"},"tree":{"sha":"e81b62a50926fcc6fff862ad483271ef4faadb6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/e81b62a50926fcc6fff862ad483271ef4faadb6d"},"message":"hscontrol/grpcv1: use EmbedObject and zf constants\n\nReplace manual field extraction with EmbedObject for node logging\nin gRPC handlers. Use zf.* constants for consistent field naming.\n\nChanges:\n- RegisterNode: use EmbedObject(node), zf.RegistrationKey, etc.\n- SetTags: use EmbedObject(node)\n- ExpireNode: use EmbedObject(node), zf.ExpiresAt\n- RenameNode: use EmbedObject(node), zf.NewName\n- SetApprovedRoutes: use zf.NodeID","parents":[{"sha":"f720da6670c5bc779a3b9d7f11b031e36865ec8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f720da6670c5bc779a3b9d7f11b031e36865ec8f","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f720da6670c5bc779a3b9d7f11b031e36865ec8f"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"d3b5aa85cd206c5437dbf66a44b6fe03068b81a4","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGQzYjVhYTg1Y2QyMDZjNTQzN2RiZjY2YTQ0YjZmZTAzMDY4YjgxYTQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/d3b5aa85cd206c5437dbf66a44b6fe03068b81a4","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/d3b5aa85cd206c5437dbf66a44b6fe03068b81a4","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:04:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:04:54Z"},"tree":{"sha":"aa191844be4044170b860a493fd31f804885042f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/aa191844be4044170b860a493fd31f804885042f"},"message":"hscontrol/mapper: use sub-loggers and zf constants\n\nAdd sub-logger patterns to worker(), AddNode(), RemoveNode() and\nmultiChannelNodeConn to eliminate repeated field calls. Use zf.*\nconstants for consistent field naming.\n\nChanges in batcher_lockfree.go:\n- Add wlog sub-logger in worker() with worker.id context\n- Add log field to multiChannelNodeConn struct\n- Initialize mc.log with node.id in newMultiChannelNodeConn()\n- Add nlog sub-loggers in AddNode() and RemoveNode()\n- Update all connection methods to use mc.log\n\nChanges in batcher.go:\n- Use zf.NodeID and zf.Reason in handleNodeChange()","parents":[{"sha":"0df60b365af628878909a14901acd21ec979d326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/0df60b365af628878909a14901acd21ec979d326","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/0df60b365af628878909a14901acd21ec979d326"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":22556103895,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887mYO0OzwAAAAVActTX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22556103895","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"d3b5aa85cd206c5437dbf66a44b6fe03068b81a4","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/d3b5aa85cd206c5437dbf66a44b6fe03068b81a4","created_at":"2026-02-05T11:41:30Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"233e8fbda0244a54306efb7f93ac33504e30492b","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDIzM2U4ZmJkYTAyNDRhNTQzMDZlZmI3ZjkzYWMzMzUwNGUzMDQ5MmI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/233e8fbda0244a54306efb7f93ac33504e30492b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/233e8fbda0244a54306efb7f93ac33504e30492b","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:54:33Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:54:33Z"},"tree":{"sha":"01a3ee03fd425c00530234c8875b5f310098b08a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/01a3ee03fd425c00530234c8875b5f310098b08a"},"message":"hscontrol/util/zlog/zf: add tag, authkey, and route constants\n\nAdd new zerolog field constants for improved logging consistency:\n\n- Tag fields: CurrentTags, RemovedTags, RejectedTags, NewTags, OldTags,\n  IsTagged, WasAuthKeyTagged\n- Node fields: ExistingNodeID\n- AuthKey fields: AuthKeyID, AuthKeyUsed, AuthKeyExpired, AuthKeyReusable,\n  NodeKeyRotation\n- Route fields: RoutesApprovedOld, RoutesApprovedNew, OldAnnouncedRoutes,\n  NewAnnouncedRoutes, ApprovedRoutes, OldApprovedRoutes, NewApprovedRoutes,\n  AutoApprovedRoutes, AllApprovedRoutes, RouteChanged","parents":[{"sha":"d3b5aa85cd206c5437dbf66a44b6fe03068b81a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/d3b5aa85cd206c5437dbf66a44b6fe03068b81a4","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/d3b5aa85cd206c5437dbf66a44b6fe03068b81a4"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":22556436336,"node_id":"RTE_lADOEFLz887mYO0OzwAAAAVAd-dw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22556436336","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-02-05T11:55:08Z","rename":{"from":"Embrace zerolog sub-loggers with EmbedObject","to":"log: implement struct integration with zerolog"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"4880522c36b2a9aa6042fa61890d4608ee90c575","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDQ4ODA1MjJjMzZiMmE5YWE2MDQyZmE2MTg5MGQ0NjA4ZWU5MGM1NzU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4880522c36b2a9aa6042fa61890d4608ee90c575","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4880522c36b2a9aa6042fa61890d4608ee90c575","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:55:20Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T11:55:20Z"},"tree":{"sha":"0d628fdececaa9499ceb812efdb8256735cefe1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/0d628fdececaa9499ceb812efdb8256735cefe1b"},"message":"hscontrol/state,db: use zf constants for logging\n\nReplace raw string field names with zf constants in state.go and\ndb/node.go for consistent, type-safe logging.\n\nstate.go changes:\n- User creation, hostinfo validation, node registration\n- Tag processing during reauth (processReauthTags)\n- Auth path and PreAuthKey handling\n- Route auto-approval and MapRequest processing\n\ndb/node.go changes:\n- RegisterNodeForTest logging\n- Invalid hostname replacement logging","parents":[{"sha":"233e8fbda0244a54306efb7f93ac33504e30492b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/233e8fbda0244a54306efb7f93ac33504e30492b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/233e8fbda0244a54306efb7f93ac33504e30492b"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"2ad2b10b33c789108c699e3a8300373bdfaeb944","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDJhZDJiMTBiMzNjNzg5MTA4YzY5OWUzYTgzMDAzNzNiZGZhZWI5NDQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2ad2b10b33c789108c699e3a8300373bdfaeb944","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2ad2b10b33c789108c699e3a8300373bdfaeb944","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T13:59:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T13:59:26Z"},"tree":{"sha":"2281702953ee13873962abdc05b425c489e59d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/2281702953ee13873962abdc05b425c489e59d8e"},"message":"all: use lowercase log messages\n\nGo style recommends that log messages and error strings should not be\ncapitalized (unless beginning with proper nouns or acronyms) and should\nnot end with punctuation.\n\nThis change normalizes all zerolog .Msg() and .Msgf() calls to start\nwith lowercase letters, following Go conventions and making logs more\nconsistent across the codebase.","parents":[{"sha":"4880522c36b2a9aa6042fa61890d4608ee90c575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4880522c36b2a9aa6042fa61890d4608ee90c575","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4880522c36b2a9aa6042fa61890d4608ee90c575"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"00c272e92a9b75b32d697c04e42f301e6b8af7dc","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDAwYzI3MmU5MmE5Yjc1YjMyZDY5N2MwNGU0MmYzMDFlNmI4YWY3ZGM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/00c272e92a9b75b32d697c04e42f301e6b8af7dc","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/00c272e92a9b75b32d697c04e42f301e6b8af7dc","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T16:29:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-05T16:29:54Z"},"tree":{"sha":"25d19d79adaa26947406c6fbd699d5968fb7594f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/25d19d79adaa26947406c6fbd699d5968fb7594f"},"message":"errors: rewrite errors to follow go best practices\n\nErrors should not start capitalised and they should not contain the word error\nor state that they \"failed\" as we already know it is an error\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@dalby.cc>","parents":[{"sha":"2ad2b10b33c789108c699e3a8300373bdfaeb944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2ad2b10b33c789108c699e3a8300373bdfaeb944","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2ad2b10b33c789108c699e3a8300373bdfaeb944"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"d63f6a46eb9d7